uTLS
----

`ranz mimic`, the mimicry sidecar of a Node (CORE-P2-1, #85), sends the ClientHello of a browser with
uTLS (https://github.com/refraction-networking/utls, v1.8.2), which it embeds as a library. uTLS is
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License of the Go authors, whose text follows. The same text covers the
parts of REALITY (below) that are forked from the crypto/tls package of Go (the file LICENSE-Go of
REALITY) and the packages acme and autocert of golang.org/x/crypto, which the sidecar uses for the
certificate of its own decoy site.

