REALITY
-------

`ranz mimic` embeds REALITY (https://github.com/XTLS/REALITY, the Go module github.com/xtls/reality, the
commit 83f621788ca8 of 2026-10-14) as a library: the server side of the transport, which answers a
connection that is no Ranz client with the real site. REALITY is licensed under the Mozilla Public
License, Version 2.0, whose text follows (the file LICENSE of REALITY). It is not modified, so its
source code form is the source of that commit, which anyone who holds ranz.exe can obtain at
https://github.com/XTLS/REALITY (section 3.2 of the licence); the text of the licence is also at
https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/. The files of Ranz VPN are not Covered Software and are not under it
(section 3.3).

